# Files rsconnect must never upload. generate_manifest.R lists the files to
# bundle explicitly; this covers a deployment made any other way.
#
# .RData and .Rhistory are a saved R session: if a dataset was loaded when it
# was saved, uploading them would put respondent data on the server.
.RData
.Rhistory
.Rproj.user
.git
.gitignore
.github
.claude
Claude outputs
tests
man
docs
PLAN.md
generate_manifest.R
